**S.1.1 Topic Coverage Completeness**: Evaluates comprehensive treatment of subject matter. Requires addressing 90% of relevant subtopics with sufficient depth, comprehensive coverage of major aspects, inclusion of related information for context, systematic coverage gap identification, and validation through expert review.

**S.1.2 Information Depth & Detail Level**: Addresses thoroughness of explanation and analysis quality. Requires sufficient detail for comprehensive understanding, thorough explanations addressing expert-level questions, high-quality analysis demonstrating expertise, appropriate detail level for audience needs, and validation through AI citation quality testing.

**S.2.1 Logical Content Organization**: Evaluates content structure and information flow. Requires clear hierarchical organization, logical information progression, effective section organization, consistent structural patterns, and navigation optimization for both human and AI users.

**S.3.1 Writing Excellence & Clarity**: Addresses language quality and communication effectiveness. Requires clear, professional writing style, grammatical accuracy, appropriate tone and voice, effective communication techniques, and readability optimization for target audience.

**S.4.1 Query Intent Satisfaction**: Evaluates alignment with user search intentions. Requires comprehensive query intent analysis, complete answer provision, user need fulfillment, search satisfaction optimization, and intent alignment validation across multiple query types.

**S.5.1 Synthetic Content Detection**: Addresses identification and validation of AI-generated content. Requires comprehensive detection mechanisms, content authenticity verification, synthetic content labeling, quality assessment protocols, and transparency in content generation methods.

**S.5.2 Content Provenance Tracking**: Evaluates content origin and creation process documentation. Requires comprehensive creation process documentation, source attribution tracking, modification history maintenance, authorship verification, and transparent provenance disclosure.

